                                "sense_id": "e07c67b9-8429-3192-ae09-e8711ce7848b",
                                "text": "And in Paris, Wick has a meeting with the Marquis, the Eiffel Tower providing a picturesque backdrop. A big, climactic scene is set on the steps and in the shadow of Sacré-Coeur."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
